## 2026-06-22 — examples 4,5,6 + the whistle made real (key upgrade)

(4) n-queens (object NQueens): recursive MORKL search; partial placement = path of column
    symbols, grounded predicate does the diagonal/column arithmetic. eval counts match OEIS
    A000170 for n=4..8; SC sound at n=6; scales to n=11 (2680, ~4s) and n=12 (14200, ~37s);
    n=13 OOMs. 7 tests.
(5) sliding puzzle (object Sliding): state = row-major tile path; grounded move generator;
    BFS reachability = same shape as datalog reachable. 3x3 FULL reachable = 181440 = 9!/2
    (matches independent BFS); 4x4 within 8 moves matches reference BFS; SC sound. 3 tests.
(6) NOAA temperature (object NOAA): real May-2026 anomaly slice extracted via h5py to
    src/test/resources/noaa_slice.txt (2592 cells, global mean +0.532 C). Binary-trie
    spatial index; restriction by a trie-prefix interval = spatial range query (Arctic band
    lat 30..35 covered by 2 prefixes -> 432 cells); restriction by a bucket = temperature
    query (very-warm anom>=1C -> 534 cells); both match reference; SC specializes the grid
    away. 4 tests.

KEY UPGRADE — the whistle is now genuinely exercised. Originally every example folded by
instance or fully evaluated static data, so generalization was dead code. Made Literals and
path Constants COUPLE in the homeomorphic embedding (any literal embeds any literal), so a
recursive configuration that grows a static accumulator trips the whistle and is GENERALIZED
into a residual loop instead of being unrolled. msg updated to emit a fresh hole for unequal
literals/constants. Effects, all still sound:
  - datalog semi-naive residual: 4/4/7 nodes -> 2 nodes (a graph-specialized loop, NOT an
    unrolling); residual size is now INDEPENDENT of |E| (proven: 2 edges vs 30 edges -> same
    node count).
  - n-queens SC residual: 8 -> 2 nodes (generic search loop).
New SCGeneralization suite (3 tests) proves: (a) the whistle is NECESSARY — with
generalize=false the symbolic reachable frontier doubles each unfold and driving hits the
node cap; (b) with generalization it terminates, the residual is self-recursive with a
generalized (variable) accumulator parameter, and eval-agrees with the original; (c) residual
size is data-independent.

Tests: **93 passing / 0 failing / 4 ignored** (baseline was 56). Two upstream correctness
bugs fixed along the way (UnwrapConcat order; subs/collect not recursing into Grounded).
All 6 guiding example domains implemented, validated against independent references and real
data files, and supercompiled. Writing SUPERCOMPILER.md.

