--- BATCH 1 LANDED (literal-by-ref + Patricia ITrie ops + sizeAtMost). full suite 157/0. ---
Strategy pieces:
 * LiteralStore: Space.Literal carried BY REFERENCE in the op-graph ("lit#<id>", value-interned)
   instead of base64-serialized at transpile. KILLS temperature transpile: 226->0.22ms (16384),
   37->0.13ms (4096). CSE now hashes a short id, not MBs. Backward-compat: non-lit# constants
   still decode via LiteralCodec (untranspile/serialization unchanged).
 * IntTrieOps (package scala.collection.immutable): union/intersection/difference as single
   simultaneous Patricia descents over IntMap[ITrie] (IntMap.Bin/Tip/Nil + IntMapUtils.bin/join/
   hasMatch/zero/shorter). Drops the per-key get+updated loop in subtraction; prunes intersect
   inline; eq short-circuits whole shared sub-tries. Property tests (300 progs + 60 fixpoints) green.
 * ITrie/Trie.sizeAtMost(cap): early-exit cardinality for Range(x,lo,hi) -> O(hi) not O(|x|).
comp+run geomean 8.349 -> 2.617 ms == 3.19x. Need ~1.57x more for 5x (target 1.670).
Per-benchmark comp+run now: aunt150 3.75 | aunt400 3.38 | nq6 18.86 | nq7 9.23 | temp4096 0.23 |
temp16384 0.33 | gol 6.82 | union_iter 0.35 | datalog40 2.91 | datalog80 12.94.
Remaining offenders: nq6 compile (push_out 6.4 + optimize_sharing 6.4 = 16ms, partly cold-JIT),
datalog80 run 12.94 (Fixpoint full re-saturation), gol run 4.2, nq7 9.23.
