  remaining distribute rules descend one level per seminaive round top-down, so literals emit as
  BALANCED trees (log-depth); egglog has no early exit → runner uses an ascending ROUNDS ladder
  (convergence window can sit below an explosion threshold, e.g. converge@12 explode@16).
