================================================================================
2026-08-06  CORRECTION: removed ALL evaluation from the abstract interpretation
================================================================================
Standing invariant (docs/design_spatial_lattice.md S0): an abstract interpretation strictly
propagates ANNOTATED (spatial) types. It must never call eval/evalI/evalT on a subterm -- a bound
obtained by running the program is an evaluation result, not an inferred one, and presenting it as an
