NOT in byLen", and `at(l)` answers from the tracked class alone for a tracked l -- but nothing ever
enforced that `restLens` excludes the tracked keys. Composition routes every rest-involving product
into the spill while the tracked class keeps only the tracked x tracked convolution, so the tracked
class omitted real paths. Unsound, not imprecise.
