`widen` -- any tracked class the spill range covers is folded INTO the spill, combining lowers with
`max` (if the buckets did overlap, the two claims may describe the same paths, so only the max is
guaranteed) and uppers with saturating `+`. Precision is lost only where widening had already given
up; terms under the caps are unaffected. Also: SpaceType.of/closed bypassed normalize, so the
documented 24-class cap did not hold -- both now route through `widen`.
