3. BOUNDED RECURSION (review.md 2) — SpatialRecursion.scala
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The exact thing review.md asked for, end to end. (i) Summaries memoised by (RoutinePtr, abstract
arguments), solved by a WORKLIST with widening — and licensed not by the schedule but by an explicit
POST-FIXED-POINT CERTIFICATION: re-deriving every key's body under the final table must give a type
⊑ the stored one. A table that fails to certify is reported and never used. Bodies are abstracted by
rewriting each Call into a placeholder mention bound to that call's summary, then calling
SpatialTyping.infer ONCE — no transfer logic duplicated. (ii) A measure μ(t) = t.len.hi with BOTH a
structural witness M1 (tails / unwrap-by-≥1 / the rest-mention of a loop over a syntactic subset) and
a numeric drop M2 along the chain. (iii) maxCallDepth = the first level whose summary is provably
empty. (iv) Residualisation with every spliced binder alpha-renamed fresh, the level-k call replaced
by Empty, wrapped in BoundedRecursion carrying its precondition.

MEASURED (SpatialRecursionCheck, 18 tests):
  * HEADLINE: maxLen 4 + one item per call -> maxCallDepth 4; μ chain 4->3->2->1->0; level-4 summary
    ⊥; Call-free residual; summaries 6 keys / 9 rounds / 4 updates / 0 widened / 0 ⊤-pinned,
    certified=true. 600 conforming inputs, 0 disagreements.
  * the annotation is LOAD-BEARING: 400 violating inputs (327 carry a >4-item path), 24
    disagreements — and applicableTo admitted 73, ZERO of them among the 24.
  * L=1..6 residual sizes 5/9/13/17/21/25 nodes, one level per unrolled call, no more.
  * GENERATED GATE: 500 routines, 341 bounded (depths 0:151 1:31 2:47 3:56 4:41 5:15), 159 NoBound
    all with a NAMED reason, 4092 differential evaluations, 0 disagreements.
  * a non-empty base case correctly gives L+1 = 5, not 4; every NoBound reason has a test.

