never summed into work. Asserted rule: no event exists without an emitter (the Fact.PrefixAbsent
"dead promise" complaint applied to this vocabulary). Backend is now Reference|Trie|Graph|Zipper,
each naming its executable, and every model returns a CostInterval(lo,hi) rather than a bare upper.

