FOUR SOUNDNESS/EXACTNESS FIXES ELSEWHERE IN THE ANALYSIS, all found by the same discipline:

  1. `SpatialDemand` CLAIMED EXACTNESS IT DID NOT HAVE.  `Layers.maxArity(d)` is a MAX over the level
