     reported figure.  It is `Sliding.collapse`:
         cells.map(b => (loc /\ b) x others(b).map(o => state(o)).reduce(_ x _)).reduce(_ \/ _)
     a 15-fold cross product of `Unwrap(state, c_i)`, one per cell.
  3. Each factor was bounded by the WHOLE state (3584) instead of by one tile.  The per-cell
