    does not reach the isolated arm's precision either.

    AND THE BUDGET IS NOT THE CAUSE EITHER — MEASURED, so the lead is closed rather than left open.
    `SpatialCost.FactBudget` was made settable and puzzle15 priced at 2000, 20000 and 200000:

        budget    alloc         touch         wall clock
